  "details": "<p>The archive is located in a private house.</p>\r\n<p><img class=\"image-inline external-image\" height=\"537\" src=\"http://oracc.ub.uni-muenchen.de/atae/images/Plan62_AssurPlan.png\" width=\"392\" /></p>",
